OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 27 MAY
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Miles Davis 100 -
OL,5,     FMiles Beyond
OL,6,     GJournalist Kevin Le Gendre
OL,7,     Gexplores how Miles Davis became
OL,8,     Gan early adopter of technology,
OL,9,     Gsuch as electric keyboards and
OL,10,     Gtape effects, changing jazz and
OL,11,     Gbeyond.
OL,12,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,13,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,14,     Gimmersive, nature-inspired
OL,15,     Gsoundtrack for late-night
OL,16,     Glistening, from classical to
OL,17,     Gcontemporary and everything in
OL,18,     Gbetween.
