OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 27 MAY
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GSoweto Kinch presents more of the
OL,6,     Gbest in jazz, and welcomes
OL,7,     Gtrumpeter Marquis Hill to reflect
OL,8,     Gon the personal impact of Miles
OL,9,     GDavis' in his centenary week.
OL,10,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,11,     GThis recital of Schubert lieder
OL,12,     Gis part of Montreal's Bourgie
OL,13,     GHall concert series of his
OL,14,     Gcomplete songs leading up to the
OL,15,     G200th anniversary of his death in
OL,16,     G1828.
